.TH MSKMAN 6 "October 2026" "mskman" "Games"
.SH NAME
mskman \- maze chase arcade game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mskman
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Guide MSK through the maze, eat every dot and avoid the four ghosts.
Eating an energizer turns the ghosts blue for a short time so they can be
eaten for bonus points. Fruit appears twice per level. After the first
two levels every level is played on a newly generated maze.
.PP
Up to four players take turns: a turn ends when the player loses a life.
Choose the number of players on the title screen with Left/Right or the
keys 1 to 4.
.SH CONTROLS
Arrow keys, WASD or HJKL move. Enter or Space starts a game. P pauses,
M toggles sound, F11 or Alt+Enter toggles fullscreen, Esc returns to the
title screen or quits. O on the title screen opens the options, where
corner assist and the speeds of MSK and the ghosts can be adjusted.
Game controllers are supported.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fullscreen
Start in fullscreen.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-scale " " \fIN\fR
Initial window scale factor (default 3).
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-mute
Start with sound muted.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-players " " \fIN\fR
Preselect 1 to 4 players.
.TP
.B \-\-autoplay
Let the computer play.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/mskman/settings.conf
(default
.IR ~/.config/mskman/settings.conf )
.br
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/mskman/highscore
(default
.IR ~/.local/share/mskman/highscore )
